{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-fafaa97716dd500cc919","title":"明帝诏高堂隆苏林秦静传经后皆卒受业废","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-fafaa97716dd500cc919","label":"正文","text":"明帝诏高堂隆苏林秦静传经后皆卒受业废","evidence":["xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c"]},{"id":"xinyang-a-68cd603d140fbeec76d4","label":"正文","text":"高堂隆等数年皆卒经学受业遂废","evidence":["xinyang-q-c863f67cb5db3b91dcf0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"诏选传经","evidence":["xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0041","role":"授经；去世","evidence":["xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c","xinyang-q-c863f67cb5db3b91dcf0"]},{"person":"wendi-p0080","role":"授经","evidence":["xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c"]},{"person":"xinyang-p-9279e83771c4d6","role":"授经","evidence":["xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c","xinyang-q-c863f67cb5db3b91dcf0"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c","order":5118}],"persons":[{"id":"xinyang-p-9279e83771c4d6","name":"秦静","evidence":["xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-9764961aef7c95b8426c","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-d7e4c494e3890e84689f","layer":"original","quote":"始，景初中，帝以苏林、秦静等并老〖1〗，恐无能传业者〖2〗。乃诏曰：“昔先圣既没〖3〗，而其遗言余教，著于六艺〖4〗。六艺之文，礼又为急，弗可斯须离者也〖5〗。末俗背本，所由来久。故闵子讥原伯之不学〖6〗，荀卿丑秦世之坑儒〖7〗；儒学既废，则风化曷由兴哉？方今宿生巨儒〖8〗，并各年高；教训之道，孰为其继？昔伏生将老〖9〗，汉文帝嗣以晁错〖10〗；《穀梁》寡畴〖11〗，宣帝承以十郎〖12〗。其料郎吏高才解经义者三十人〖13〗，从光禄勋隆、散骑常侍林、博士静，分受四经三礼〖14〗；主者具为设课试之法〖15〗。夏侯胜有言〖16〗：‘士病不明经术〖17〗；经术苟明，其取青紫如俯拾地芥耳〖18〗。’今学者有能究极经道，则爵禄荣宠，不期而至。可不勉哉！”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":612,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":325,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-c863f67cb5db3b91dcf0","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-4ffcaaf84f61c7b8106a","layer":"original","quote":"数年，隆等皆卒，学者遂废。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":613,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
